# 换行符策略：仓库内统一按 LF 存储，Windows 脚本检出时自动转 CRLF。
# 没有这份文件时，除 ai_compiler 外的 .bat 在 Windows 上会是 LF —— 批处理对 LF 有已知隐患。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做任何换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.glb  binary
*.gltf binary
*.wasm binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.zip  binary
*.tar  binary
*.gz   binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
